ds\n\nChandak Treesourus in Malad West is a luxury project by the Chandak Group (35+ years experience) that promises a fusion of nature and modern comfort. Registered under MahaRERA No. P51800048658, it features Luxury 2 & 3 BHK Sun-Deck Homes, including 'Largest In Class' units and Duplexes. Located off Chincholi Bunder Road, it offers 20+ amenities and convenient access to the New Link Road, Infiniti Mall, and Goregaon Sports Club, reflecting the developer's commitment to quality and efficient delivery.\n\n## ProjectDetails\n\n![Project Type](/projectOverview/icons/project-type.svg)\n\n#### Project Type\n\nResidential\n\n![Status](/projectOverview/icons/status.svg)\n\n#### Status\n\nUnder Construction\n\n![Project Area](/projectOverview/icons/project-area.svg)\n\n#### Project Area\n\n1549 SQM\n\n![Towers](/projectOverview/icons/tower.svg)\n\n#### Towers\n\n2\n\n![Configurations](/projectOverview/icons/configuration.svg)\n\n#### Configurations\n\n2, 3, 4 & 5 BHK Apartments\n\n![Total Floors](/projectOverview/icons/total-units.svg)\n\n#### Total Floors\n\n66\n\n![Amenities](/projectOverview/icons/amenities.svg)\n\n#### Amenities\n\n33 Amenities\n\n![Parking](/projectOverview/icons/parking.svg)\n\n#### Parking\n\nAvailable\n\n![Locality](/projectOverview/icons/locality.svg)\n\n#### Locality\n\nMalad West\n\n![Pin code](/projectOverview/icons/pincode.svg)\n\n#### Pin Code\n\n400064\n\n![Landmark](/projectOverview/icons/landmark.svg)\n\n#### Landmark\n\nChinchavali English Mumbai Public School\n\n![Address](/projectOverview/icons/address.svg)\n\n#### Address\n\nChincholi Bunder Rd, Malad, Chincholi Bunder, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n## Configurations\n\n2 BHK718 - 744 sq.ft\n\n₹ 2.70 – 2.80 Crore\n\n3 BHK1,019 - 1,091 sq.ft\n\n₹ 3.80 – 4.09 Crore\n\n4 BHK1,451 - 1,495 sq.ft\n\n₹ 5.60 Crore\n\n5 BHK1,761 - 2,113 sq.ft\n\n₹ 6.60 – 7.91 Crore\n\n![background pattern](/icons/BgPattern.svg)\n\nMumbai\n\n## Want to Schedule a Site Visit?\n\nExplore the property in person at your convenience.\n\n![schedule illustration](/icons/Illustration.svg)\n\n## FloorPlans\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.70 Cr\n\n718 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.70 Cr\n\n718sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.70 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.72 Cr\n\n722 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.72 Cr\n\n722sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.72 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.75 Cr\n\n731 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.75 Cr\n\n731sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.75 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.78 Cr\n\n738 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.78 Cr\n\n738sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.78 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n2 BHK₹ 2.80 Cr\n\n744 sq.ftCarpet Area\n\n![2 BHK floor plan](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n### 2 BHK\n\n₹ 2.80 Cr\n\n744sq.ft\n\nCarpet Area\n\n![₹ 2.80 Cr](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/floor-plans/2bhk.jpeg)\n\nPossession  \nin Dec 2028\n\n## AboutProject\n\nChandak Treesourus, located off Chincholi Bunder Road in Malad West, is a luxury residential project designed to be a nature-infused urban sanctuary. The project’s unique concept is reflected in its name, which suggests a \"thesaurus\" of nature, where \"nature comes home.\" It offers premium configurations, including Luxury 2 & 3 BHK Sun-Deck Homes, with options for Jodi apartments and spacious Duplexes, featuring some of the \"Largest In Class\" 3 BHK sun-deck units. The residential experience is complemented by over 20 top-tier modern amenities, ensuring a complete and active lifestyle for all age groups. The emphasis is on spacious homes filled with urban comforts and super spacious balconies, allowing residents to fully appreciate the great views and the surrounding greenery. Its location provides easy access to the New Link Road and proximity to key social hubs like Infiniti Mall, Mindspace Malad, and the Goregaon Sports Club. Chandak Treesourus is registered under the mandatory compliance of MahaRERA with the number P51800048658.\n\n## Amenities\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/children-play-area-56fac0.png)\n\nChildren's Play Area\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/jogging-track-445640.png)\n\nJogging Track\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/meditation-hall-e68efc.png)\n\nMeditation Zone\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/swimming-pool-79335b.png)\n\nSwimming Pool\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/library.svg)\n\nLibrary\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/30/IMAGE/security-guardspng1-f1b764.png)\n\nSecurity\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/indoor-games-5c6e97.png)\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/power-backup.svg)\n\nPower Backup\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/security-guards.svg)\n\nSecurity Guards\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24-7-water-supply.svg)\n\n24 7 Water Supply\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/24x7-security.svg)\n\n24x7 Security\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/cctv-surveillance.svg)\n\nCctv Surveillance\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/Amenities-new/grand-entrance-lobby.svg)\n\nGrand Entrance Lobby\n\n![](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/06/18/IMAGE/cafeteria-e9dfea.png)\n\nCafeteria\n\n## ProjectGallery\n\n## Brochure\n\n1of1\n\n## AboutLocation\n\nMalad West is a lively and self-sufficient Mumbai suburb known for its busy commercial and shopping scene, including major malls and corporate parks. This dynamic area offers a diverse real estate market, from affordable homes to luxury residences. With plenty of dining and entertainment options, and great connectivity through Link Road and SV Road, it provides a lifestyle of ultimate convenience. An investment here guarantees a complete city experience where work and leisure are perfectly balanced in a thriving, well-connected community.\n\n## Maps\n\nInitializing Map...\n\n![Verified](/icons/green-check.svg)RERA Verified Project\n\n### What is RERA ?\n\nRERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) is a government regulatory body established under the Real Estate (Regulation and Development) Act, 2016 in India.\n\nIts primary purpose is to regulate the real estate sector, increase transparency, and protect home buyers from fraud, project delays, and unfair practices.\n\n![RERA Approved](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/public/rera.png)\n\n![RERA QR Code](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/1765018521782-59853164323fb34b.jpg)\n\nRERA ID\n\nP51800048658\n\n## AboutDeveloper\n\n[![Chandak Group](https://assets.nobrokerage.com/production/2026/05/12/IMAGE/chandak-logo-jpg-1-d2103c.jpg)](/builder/chandak-group \"Chandak Group\")\n\nChandak Group![Check](/icons/green-check.svg)\n\nYears of Experience –40 years\n\nThe development is proudly managed by M/s. Shreeraj Developer LLP, an integral part of the highly regarded Chandak Group, which has cultivated a strong market presence through its core philosophy of \"Promises Made. Promises Kept.\" Chandak is universally recognized for its unwavering commitment to providing a transparent, efficient, and genuinely enjoyable home-buying experience for every customer. A major pillar of their reputation is the assurance of on-time project delivery, a vital factor that instills confidence and certainty in their clientele. The company dedicates itself to meticulously designing residences that are both highly functional and supremely comfortable, firmly rooted in strong industry principles.\n\n37ProjectsCompleted\n\n11OngoingProjects\n\n2In CityProjects\n\n## Disclaimer\n\nNoBrokerage.com is a real estate advertising and information platform. We are not a real estate broker, agent, or channel partner, and we do not facilitate or participate in any property transactions.\n\nThe data displayed on this website is based on inputs from developers, owners, or public sources, and is provided for informational purposes only. While we aim for accuracy, we do not verify the data and make no guarantees regarding its completeness or correctness.\n\nNo information on this website constitutes legal, financial, or investment advice, nor should it be treated as an invitation to purchase or acquire any property. Project listings do not imply RERA registration or regulatory compliance. Users are advised to verify all information independently and consult the relevant RERA authority. All third-party names, images, logos, and trademarks belong to their respective owners.\n\nFor feedback or concerns, email: [support@nobrokerage.com](mailto:support@nobrokerage.com)\n\nLoading reviews...\n\n# Frequently Asked\n\nQuestions\n\nGet answers to the most common questions about Chandak Treesourus in West Pune\n\nChandak Treesourus is developed by Chandak realtors private limited, a reputed real estate developer in the region.\n\nChandak Treesourus is conveniently located near major transport hubs, ensuring seamless connectivity for daily travel.\n\nYou can view the exact map location of Chandak Treesourus at available coordinates for better navigation and site visit planning.\n\nThe expected possession date of Chandak Treesouru