0to%20enquire%20about%20a%20property.)   [9892340129](tel:919892340129)\n\n![Divya Housing Agency](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/themes/divya-housing-premium/assets/images/logo.webp)\n\n![Chandak Treesourus — Photo 1](https://divyahousingagency.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/Chandak-Treesourus.jpg) 1 / 8\n\n![]()\n\nFor Sale Under Construction\n\n# Chandak Treesourus 2 BHK 718 SqFt Flat in Chincholi Bunder, Malad West\n\n[Chincholi Bunder, Malad West](https://divyahousingagency.com/area/malad-west/)  — Chandak Treesourus, Chincholi Bunder, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\n**₹2.40 Cr++** ₹33,426 /SqFt\n\n[RERA: P51800048658](https://maharera.mahaonline.gov.in)\n\nConfig **2 BHK**\n\nCarpet **718 SqFt**\n\nRERA **P51800048658**\n\n## Project Information\n\nProject / Building\n\nChandak Treesourus\n\nProperty Type\n\nApartment\n\nConfiguration\n\n2 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n718 SqFt\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\n[P51800048658](https://maharera.mahaonline.gov.in)\n\nLocation\n\nMalad West\n\nAddress\n\nChandak Treesourus, Chincholi Bunder, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra\n\nParking\n\n1\n\nBathrooms\n\n2\n\nOverview\n\n## About Chandak Treesourus\n\n## Chandak Treesourus\n\n#### 2BHK | 3BHK | Residential Apartment | In Malad West | On Sale |\n\nChandak Treesourus by Chandak Group is a newly launched project in Western Mumbai, offering spacious apartments on a mid-range budget. This affordable luxury project brings you apartments in Chincholi Bunder, which are scheduled for **possession in Dec 2028**. Chandak Treesourus Western Mumbai is a RERA-registered project with registration number **P51800048658**. Chandak Treesourus Chincholi Bunder has **2 towers, with Ground+10 Parking, + 11th Floor Amenities+ 12th to 53 floors each, and 738 units** to offer. This project is spread over an area of 0.38 acres. With all the basic amenities available, Chandak Treesourus offers comfort and a lifestyle at a reasonable price.\n\n###### **How is Chincholi Bunder for property investment?**\n\nChincholi Bunder is one of the attractive real estate destinations to own a home in Western Mumbai. With promising social and physical infrastructure, it is one of the choicest areas for families in Western Mumbai. Chincholi Bunder has decent connectivity to some of the important areas in the proximity such as J Kumar International School, Vidya Vikas Universal College Vivanta Hospital, and so on.\n\n###### **What is the future of the Western Mumbai property market?**\n\nWestern Mumbai real estate market has a range of property options in various price brackets. Chincholi Bunder in Western Mumbai is one of the localities known for housing affordable residential projects which makes it a suitable destination for homebuyers looking for a property for self-use or investment purposes in the city. One thing that makes Western Mumbai different from any other city in this region is its potential to attract investors through its flourishing job market and employment opportunities, bringing in fresh housing demand regularly. In addition to this, with metro connectivity improving and other infrastructure projects coming up in Western Mumbai, these growth drivers are expected to influence the property prices here extensively.\n\n###### **Chandak Treesourus at Malad west Project By chandak Group**\n\n**Chandak Treesourus Malad West** is a premium residential project located in the bustling city of Mumbai. Developed by the renowned Chandak Group, the project offers luxurious apartments that cater to the needs of modern-day living. The project is strategically located in Malad West, one of the rapidly developing areas of Mumbai, and offers easy connectivity to various parts of the city.\n\nSpread across sprawling huge acres of land, Chandak Treesourus offers spacious and well-designed apartments that are designed to provide maximum comfort and convenience to the residents. The project offers limited edition apartments that are spread across tall towers. The towers are designed to provide a stunning view of the surrounding landscape and are equipped with state-of-the-art amenities that ensure a comfortable and luxurious living experience.\n\nChandak Treesourus Apartments are available in different configurations to suit the diverse needs of the residents. The project offers 2, 3 BHK, and Jodi apartments with spacious carpet areas. The apartments are designed to provide ample natural light and\n\nGetting Here\n\n## Location & Nearby Connectivity\n\nNearest Metro\n\n**Malad West Metro Station**\n\nNearest Railway\n\n**Malad Railway Station**\n\nNearest Landmark\n\n**Mindspace Junction**\n\nNearby Malls\n\n**Evershie Mall Malad**\n\nHealthcare Nearby\n\n**Lifeline Medicare Hospital****Cloudnine Hospital**\n\nBusiness Hubs Nearby\n\n**Mindspace Malad**\n\n## Amenities & Features\n\nCar Parking\n\nCCTV Security\n\nElEVators\n\nFire Alarm\n\nGym\n\nIntercom\n\nJogging Tread\n\nKids Play Area\n\nMaintenance Staff\n\nMeditation &Amp; Yoga Zone\n\nMeditation Deck\n\nParty Lawn\n\nPower BACkup\n\nSenior Citizen's Corner\n\nSwimming Pool\n\nNeighbourhood\n\n## About Malad West\n\nMalad West is a well-connected western suburb location with residential options across ready, resale and new-launch properties. Buyers usually compare projects here by carpet area, possession stage, connectivity, amenities and budget.For current availability in this neighbourhood, speak with Divya Housing Agency and compare verified options before booking a visit.\n\n [View all properties in Malad West →](https://divyahousingagency.com/area/malad-west/)\n\n**Client**Testimonials\n\nVisible feedback shown for trust; no self-serving review schema is generated.\n\n★★★★★\n\nFound our 2 BHK in Malad West within our budget in just 3 site visits. The team knew exactly which pockets to show us.\n\n**Rahul Sharma** 2 BHK buyer Evershine Nagar\n\n★★★★★\n\nOne call to Divya Housing and we had 4 genuine options the same week. No time wasting, no fake listings. Closed in 3 weeks.\n\