ng Type\n\n0.38 Acres\n\n40 Storeys\n\n![Possession Date](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/calendar.svg) Possession Date\n\n![Possession Status](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/construction.svg) Possession Status\n\n![ Number of Storey's](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/img/building.svg) Project Rera No.\n\nDecember 2028\n\nUnder Construction\n\n---\n\n### Key Highlights\n\n* **Project Name**: Chandak Treesourus (Codename Chandak Nostalgia)\n* **Developer**: Chandak Group\n* **Configuration**: 2 & 3 BHK Apartments\n* **Carpet Area**: 718 – 1068 sq.ft.\n* **Price**: ₹2.5 Cr – ₹3.42 Cr\n* **Land Parcel**: 3.5 Acres\n* **Possession**: December 2028\n\n---\n\n### Introduction\n\nChandak Treesourus, also known as Codename Chandak Nostalgia, is a premium residential project by the reputed Chandak Group, located in the prime residential area of Malad West, Mumbai. Spread across 3.5 acres, the project features elegant 2 and 3 BHK apartments, designed to offer a serene and spacious living experience in the heart of the city.\n\nWith carpet areas ranging from 718 sq.ft. to 1068 sq.ft., and prices starting from ₹2.5 Cr to ₹3.42 Cr, Chandak Treesourus is ideal for homebuyers looking for a future-ready, well-connected property in Mumbai's western suburbs.\n\n✅ **Why Buy a Flat in Chandak Treesourus, Malad West?**\n\n* Spacious 2 & 3 BHK residences\n* Strategically located in Malad West, Mumbai\n* Close to metro station, malls, schools, and hospitals\n* Premium amenities like a swimming pool, clubhouse, gym, kids’ zone & more\n* Possession by **December 2028**\n\n📍 **Location Advantage – Malad West, Mumbai**\n\nMalad West is a well-developed locality with excellent infrastructure and connectivity to:\n\n* Western Express Highway & Link Road\n* Infinity Mall, Inorbit Mall\n* Goregaon-Malad commercial hubs\n* Top schools & healthcare centers​\n\n[Read More](javascript:void(0);) [Read Less](javascript:void(0);)\n\n---\n\n### Download 