n* Ideal English High School\n* Amity Global Business School\n\n**Hospitals in Malad West**\n\n* CritiCare Asia Multispeciality Hospital\n* Cloudnine Hospital - Malad | Best Maternity & Pregnancy\n* Thunga Hospital\n* Balajee Hospital\n* ACE Heart Hospital\n\n**Shopping and Entertainment in Malad West**\n\n* Infiniti Mall\n* Oberoi Mall\n* Inorbit Mall Malad\n* Growel's 101 Mall\n\n## About Chandak Group\n\n![Chandak Group](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/public/uploads/developer/ymcEzinZm9LeLcA0ILqMlbP5SgHVRfsgKk9qV9tT.jpg)\n\n* Year Estd. 1986\n* [Projects - 19](https://keystonerealestateadvisory.com/buy/chandak-group-projects-in-mumbai)\n\n#### Chandak Group\n\nChandak Group is a prominent real estate developer with a strong presence in Mumbai, India. Established in 1986, the company has a proven track record of delivering high-\n\nread more\n\nquality residential and commercial projects. With a primary focus on the Mumbai metropolitan region, Chandak Group has successfully fulfilled the city's growing demand for real estate solutions. Known for its commitment to timely project completion, Chandak Group has earned the reputation of being a reliable and trustworthy developer. Their \"\"Promises Made, Promises Kept\"\" tagline underscores this dedication. The company offers a diverse portfolio of residential and commercial properties, catering to the varied needs of its customers. With a customer-centric approach, Chandak Group has created homes for over 10,000 families. Building strong relationships with its customers is a core value for the company. The group has a substantial development history, with over 12 million square feet of completed projects and an additional 4+ million square feet in its pipeline. In conclusion, Chandak Group is a prominent real estate developer in Mumbai, known for its high quality, timely delivery, and customer-centric approach.\n\nread less\n\n## QR Codes of Chandak Treesourus\n\n![P51800048658.webp](https://keystonerealestat